{"type": "sena", "_data": [{"contents": [{"type": "lesson_name", "content": "Living the Dream"}, {"type": "unit_name", "content": "They Say Yes!"}, {"type": "position", "content": 10}, {"type": "origin", "content": "stub"}, {"type": "lesson", "content": 16}, {"type": "level", "content": "B2.1"}], "type": "metadata"}, {"contents": [{"type": "test", "content": "false"}], "type": "achievment_test"}, {"contents": [{"type": "primary", "content": "Describe hypothetical situations in written and spoken interactions according to work and social contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_1", "content": " Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_2", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_3", "content": "Understands general and detailed information as well as attitude and intention on a wide range of general and work topics, in conversations or presentations, spoken at a natural speed and in circumstances that make it more difficult to hear."}, {"type": "secondary_4", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": " Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Understands specific information in written texts about the different social and work contexts."}], "type": "objectives"}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn9le16ob10re1img01.jpg"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " Reported Speech and Questions"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You use reported speech when you are saying (reporting)  what other people said or asked. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you tell people what someone has said in the past, you need to change the verb to the next past form. You need to change the verb to the next past form. "}, {"type": "text", "content": "For example:"}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":6,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Direct speech                             </span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Reported speech</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Rachel: \u201cThey <span class=\\\"strong\\\">hired</span>  him.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She said they <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had hired </span> him.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Jill: \u201cI'<span class=\\\"strong\\\">m coming</span>  to lunch.\u201d               \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She said she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">was coming</span>. \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Oliver: \u201cI already <span class=\\\"strong\\\">emailed </span> them.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he <span class=\\\"strong\\\">had already </span> emailed them.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Beth: \u201cI<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> can </span> get you a job.\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She told me she <span class=\\\"strong\\\">could </span> get me a job.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Adam: \u201cWhere do you <span class=\\\"strong\\\">work </span> now?\u201d\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He asked me where I <span class=\\\"strong\\\">worked </span> now.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}"}, {"type": "text", "content": "You have to change the pronoun if you are reporting what someone else said. Compare these two sentences. In each case the person actually said \"I don't want to go.\" <ul><li>I said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >     I said <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">I</span></span> didn't want to go.</li><li>Bill said, \u201cI don't want to go.\u201d  >  Bill said <span class=\"strong\"><span class=\"italic\">he</span></span> didn't want to go.</li></ul>"}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"prelo-letter-page-break\"></span>Look at the chart below to see the changes in verb tense."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":12,\"columns\":4,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Direct speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Reported speech\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Example\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Present\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Gail: \\\"She is my boss.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She said she was her boss.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Ben: \\\"I'm coming right now.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"  Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he was coming right now.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Simple Past\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Drew: \\\"I had a lot of meetings last week.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" He said he had had a lot of meetings last week.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Present Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Fiona: \\\"We've never had such a great boss.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Perfect\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"She said they had never had such a great boss.\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\" Past Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Sam: \\\"I was wondering where you were.\\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Past Perfect Progressive\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"He said he had been wondering where I had been.\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "What did they say?<br/>They said they thought I would be an ideal fit for the team."}, {"type": "example", "content": "When did they say you would start?<br/> They said I would start on February 7th."}, {"type": "example", "content": "What did they say you would be doing?<br/>They said I would be an editorial assistant."}, {"type": "example", "content": "Did they mention how much cash you would be making?<br/> Boris told me it would be $42,000 to start."}, {"type": "text", "content": "When you want to report questions asked, the subject normally comes before the verb. <br> For example: <br> <span class=\"underline\">Direct</span>:<span class=\"italic\"> \"What are you doing?\"</span> <br> <span class=\"underline\">Indirect</span>: <span class=\"italic\">She asked me what I was doing.</span> "}, {"type": "text", "content": "When the question is a yes/no questions, you use <span class=\"strong\">if </span> or <span class=\"strong\">whether </span>to report it. <br> For example: <br> <span class=\"underline\">Direct</span>: <span class=\"italic\">Is that the report you were talking about?</span> <br> <span class=\"underline\">Indirect</span>: <span class=\"italic\">He wondered if that was the report I had been talking about. </span>"}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": " The Future"}, {"type": "describer", "content": " You can use four different tenses to talk about the future and making future plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Will</span>:<br/> When you make a quick decision at the moment of speaking.<br/>To make predictions, offers, promises."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Be going to</span>:<br/> When you ask about intentions and plans."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Present Continuous Tense</span>:<br/> When you talk about things that are arranged, on the agenda or booked for the future."}, {"type": "text", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Simple Present</span>:<br/> When you talk about schedules."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":4,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Will</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> I'll be right back.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Be going to</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm going to go to a movie tomorrow.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\"> Present Continuous</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">We are having dinner tomorrow at 8 p.m.</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">Simple Present</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\"> The bus number 17 stops at 8 o'clock every day.</span>\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team."}, {"type": "example", "content": " I am meeting with the CEO tomorrow and will inform him then."}, {"type": "example", "content": "As we discussed, your starting date is going to be February 8, 2016. "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We are have a meeting that day at noon, so it will be a perfect time to introduce you to everyone."}, {"type": "example", "content": "The starting wage will be $50,000 per year and is paid on a weekly basis.  "}, {"type": "example", "content": "We will discuss this in further detail upon your arrival."}], "type": "learning_points"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "ideal"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "perfect"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(adjective)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team.  "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le16ob10aud01"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " These are words you use when you get a new job."}], "type": "target_word_describer"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "sick leave"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "paid sick days"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: BFP offers excellent benefits which includes vacation and sick leave."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le16ob10aud02"}], "type": "target_word"}, {"contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "benefits package"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "medical insurance, dental insurance and other perks offered to employees"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: They said that they had a good benefits package as well. "}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn9le16ob10aud03"}], "type": "target_wo