"</span>Kristi,<br /><br />BFP is pleased to offer you the position of Editorial Assistant. Your skills and experience will be an ideal fit for our team. I am meeting with the CEO tomorrow and will inform him then.<br/>\nAs we discussed, your starting date is going to be February 8, 2016.<br/>\nWe are having a meeting that day at noon, so it will be a perfect time to introduce you to everyone.<br/>", "id": 2, "image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "62000", "text": "The starting wage will be $50,000 per year and is paid on a weekly basis.  BFP offers excellent benefits which includes vacation and sick leave.<br/>\nWe will discuss this in further detail upon your arrival.<br /><br />\nBest regards,<br />\nBoris B.<br/>\n<span class=\"italic\">&#60;boris.brody@bfp.com\t&#62;</span>", "id": 3, "image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img06.jpg"}, {"time": "86000", "text": "<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: I got the job!<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Yeah! Congrats! What did they say?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said they thought I would be an ideal fit for the team.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>:  When did they say you would start?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said I would start on February 8th.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: What did they say you would be doing?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said I would be an editorial assistant.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>:  Nice! Did they mention how much cash you would be making?<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: Boris told me it would be $50,000 to start.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Oh. Well that's ok for an entry level position.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Kristi</span>: They said that they had a good benefits package as well.<br/>\n<span class=\"strong\">Bianca</span>: Oh! I'm so excited for you!", "id": 4, "image": "engenn9le16ob10re2img07.jpg"}], "coverimg": "engenn9le16ob10re2img05.jpg"}}], "id": 1, "template_override": 1, "type": "audio", "title": "", "_data": []}]}]}